#: ../../source/janim/timeline/core.rst:2
msgid "core"
msgstr "core"

#: janim.timeline.core.ScheduledTask:1 of
msgid "在 Timeline 中计划执行的函数，所对应的参数信息"
msgstr "The function scheduled to be executed in Timeline and its corresponding parameter information"

#: ../../source/janim/timeline/core.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: janim.timeline.core.ScheduledTask:3 janim.timeline.core.TimeOfCode:3 of
msgid "全局时刻"
msgstr "Global time"

#: janim.timeline.core.ScheduledTask:4 of
msgid "函数体"
msgstr "Function body"

#: janim.timeline.core.ScheduledTask:5 of
msgid "位置参数"
msgstr "Positional arguments"

#: janim.timeline.core.ScheduledTask:6 of
msgid "具名参数"
msgstr "Keyword arguments"

#: janim.timeline.core.ScheduledTask:8 of
msgid "在 Timeline 到达 ``global_t`` 后，``args`` 与 ``kwargs`` 会被传入 ``func`` 调用"
msgstr "After Timeline reaches ``global_t``, ``args`` and ``kwargs`` will be passed to ``func`` for invocation"

#: janim.timeline.core.ScheduledTask:10 of
msgid "另见 :meth:`~.TimelineCore.schedule`"
msgstr "See also :meth:`~.TimelineCore.schedule`"

#: janim.timeline.core.ExtraRenderGroup:1 of
msgid "一些特殊动画类注册的额外渲染"
msgstr "Additional rendering registered by some special animation classes"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimeOfCode:1 of
msgid "标记 :meth:`~.Timeline.construct` 执行到的代码行数所对应的时间"
msgstr "Marks the time corresponding to the line number of code execution in :meth:`~.Timeline.construct`"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimeOfCode:4 of
msgid "在代码文件中的行数，表示到 ``time`` 为止的时间，都对应这行代码"
msgstr "The line number in the code file, indicating that all times up to ``time`` correspond to this line of code"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore:1 of
msgid ""
"封装了 :class:`Timeline` 的核心功能， 会通过继承其它类来扩充成 :class:`~.Timeline` 类， 关于扩充功能的介绍，请参"
"考 :class:`~.Timeline` 的文档"
msgstr ""
"Encapsulates the core functionality of :class:`Timeline`. It is extended through inheritance from other classes to form "
"the :class:`~.Timeline` class. For information about the extended functionality, see the documentation "
"of :class:`~.Timeline`"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore:5 of
msgid "这只是为了 JAnim 内部代码组织的方便，并不能单独使用， 我们使用的时候直接用 :class:`~.Timeline` 就好了"
msgstr ""
"This class only exists for the convenience of JAnim's internal code organization and cannot be used independently. When "
"using JAnim, simply use :class:`~.Timeline` directly"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore:10 of
msgid "该类中的方法都可以直接在 :class:`~.Timeline` 中使用"
msgstr "All methods in this class can be used directly in :class:`~.Timeline`"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.forward:1 of
msgid "向前推进 ``dt`` 秒"
msgstr "Advance by ``dt`` seconds"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.forward_to:1 of
msgid "向前推进到 ``t`` 秒的时候"
msgstr "Advance to time ``t``"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.prepare:1 of
msgid "应用动画但不向前推进时间"
msgstr "Apply animations without advancing time"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.play:1 of
msgid "播放动画，并将时间推进到动画的末尾"
msgstr "Play animations and advance time to the end of the animations"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.schedule:1 of
msgid "计划执行"
msgstr "Schedule execution"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.schedule:3 of
msgid "会在进度达到 ``global_t`` 时，对 ``func`` 进行调用， 可传入 ``*args`` 和 ``**kwargs``"
msgstr "Calls ``func`` when the progress reaches ``global_t``. ``*args`` and ``**kwargs`` can be passed to it"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.schedule_and_detect_changes:1 of
msgid "与 :meth:`schedule` 类似，但是在调用 ``func`` 后会记录变化的物件的状态"
msgstr "Similar to :meth:`schedule`, but records the state of changed items after calling ``func``"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.timeout:1 of
msgid "相当于 ``schedule(self.current_time + delay, func, *args, **kwargs)``"
msgstr "Equivalent to ``schedule(self.current_time + delay, func, *args, **kwargs)``"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.timeout_and_detect_changes:1 of
msgid "与 :meth:`timeout` 类似，但是在调用 ``func`` 后会记录变化的物件的状态"
msgstr "Similar to :meth:`timeout`, but records the state of changed items after calling ``func``"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.early_invoke_scheduled_function:1 of
msgid "提前执行已在计划执行中的指定函数"
msgstr "Execute a scheduled function ahead of time"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.early_invoke_scheduled_function:3 of
msgid "先前计划执行的函数"
msgstr "The previously scheduled function"

#: ../../source/janim/timeline/core.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.early_invoke_scheduled_function:4 of
msgid "是否找到匹配的函数"
msgstr "Whether a matching function was found"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.track:1 of
msgid "使得 ``item`` 在每次 ``forward`` 和 ``play`` 时都会被自动检查是否发生状态改变，并记录状态变化"
msgstr ""
"Causes ``item`` to be automatically checked for state changes and records those changes on each ``forward`` and ``play``"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.track_item_and_descendants:1 of
msgid "相当于对 ``item`` 及其所有的后代物件调用 :meth:`track`"
msgstr "Equivalent to calling :meth:`track` on ``item`` and all its descendant items"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.detect_changes_of_all:1 of
msgid "检查追踪的所有物件的变化并将变化记录"
msgstr "Checks all tracked items for changes and records them"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.detect_changes:1 of
msgid "检查指定的列表中物件的变化，并将变化记录"
msgstr "Checks items in the specified list for changes and records them"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.detect_changes:3 of
msgid "（仅检查自身而不包括后代物件的）"
msgstr "(Only checks itself, excluding descendant items)"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.compute_item:1 of
msgid "另见 :meth:`~.AnimStack.compute`"
msgstr "See :meth:`~.AnimStack.compute`"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.item_current:1 of
msgid "另见 :meth:`~.Item.current`"
msgstr "See :meth:`~.Item.current`"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.is_visible:1 of
msgid "判断特定的物件目前是否可见"
msgstr "Determine whether a specific item is currently visible"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.is_visible:3 of
msgid "另见：:meth:`show`、:meth:`hide`"
msgstr "See also: :meth:`show`, :meth:`hide`"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.show:1 of
msgid "显示物件"
msgstr "Show item"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.hide:1 of
msgid "隐藏物件"
msgstr "Hide item"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.hide_all:1 of
msgid "隐藏显示中的所有物件"
msgstr "Hide all items currently displayed"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.visible_items:1 of
msgid "得到当前可见的所有物件"
msgstr "Gets all currently visible items"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.visible_items:3 of
msgid "物件列表"
msgstr "List of items"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.add_extra_render_group:1 of
msgid "注册额外渲染，用于 :class:`~.Transform` 等特殊动画类"
msgstr "Registers additional rendering for special animation classes such as :class:`~.Transform`"

#: janim.timeline.core.TimelineCore.get_lineno_at_time:1 of
msgid "根据 ``time`` 得到对应执行到的行数"
msgstr "Get the corresponding line number based on ``time``."

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearance:1 of
msgid "包含与物件显示有关的对象"
msgstr "Contains objects related to item display"

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearance:3 of
msgid "``self.stack`` 即 :class:`~.AnimStack` 对象"
msgstr "``self.stack`` is the :class:`~.AnimStack` object"

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearance:5 of
msgid "``self.visiblility`` 是一个列表，存储物件显示/隐藏的时间点"
msgstr "``self.visiblility`` is a list that stores the time points when an item is shown or hidden"

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearance:6 of
msgid "列表中偶数下标（0、2、...）的表示开始显示的时间点，奇数下标（1、3、...）的表示隐藏的时间点"
msgstr ""
"Elements at even indices (0, 2, ...) in the list represent the time points when the item starts being shown, while "
"elements at odd indices (1, 3, ...) represent the time points when it is hidden"

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearance:7 of
msgid "例如，如果列表中是 ``[3, 4, 8]``，则表示在第 3s 显示，第 4s 隐藏，并且在第 8s 后一直显示"
msgstr ""
"For example, if the list is ``[3, 4, 8]``, it means the item is shown at 3s, hidden at 4s, and remains shown after 8s"

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearance:8 of
msgid "这种记录方式是 :meth:`TimelineCore.is_visible`、:meth:`TimelineCore.show`、:meth:`TimelineCore.hide` 运作的基础"
msgstr ""
"This recording method is the basis for the operation of :meth:`TimelineCore.is_visible`, :meth:`TimelineCore.show`, "
"and :meth:`TimelineCore.hide`"

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearance:10 of
msgid "``self.renderer`` 表示所使用的渲染器对象"
msgstr "``self.renderer`` represents the renderer object being used"

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearance.is_visible_at:1 of
msgid "在 ``t`` 时刻，物件是否可见"
msgstr "Whether the item is visible at time ``t``"

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearances:1 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "本质上是一个 ``{Item: ItemAppearance}`` 的 ``dict``"
msgstr "Essentially, it is a ``dict`` of ``{Item: ItemAppearance}``"

#: janim.timeline.core.ItemAppearances:3 of
msgid ""
"但是如果 ``key`` 不存在，则会自动新建一个 ``key`` 物件 所对应的 :class:`ItemAppearance`，并记录其当前状态作为初始状态"
msgstr ""
"However, if ``key`` does not exist, an :class:`ItemAppearance` corresponding to the ``key`` item will be created "
"automatically, and its current state will be recorded as the initial state"
